---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
const interests=['Enterprise','Government','Technical architecture','Upcoming network version'];
const interest=Astro.url.searchParams.get('interest')||'';
---
<Layout title="Request a demo"><section class="container demo-page"><div class="demo-intro"><span class="eyebrow">LET’S LOOK AT YOUR USE CASE</span><h1>Bring your<br/>architecture.<br/><span class="serif-word">Let’s talk files.</span></h1><p class="hero-lead">Trace the file path, the key path and authorized reconstruction against the data and applications your business depends on.</p><div class="demo-agenda"><span class="tiny-label">WHAT TO EXPLORE</span><div><span>01</span><p>Your files, workflows and threat model</p></div><div><span>02</span><p>The file path, key path and reconstruction process</p></div><div><span>03</span><p>Deployment fit and technical evaluation criteria</p></div></div><div class="demo-note"><span><svg class="diagonal-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span><p>Interested in the upcoming network version? Explore how cryptographic material is fragmented and multiple key components are protected through the HSM architecture.</p></div></div><div class="form-card"><span class="tiny-label">START THE CONVERSATION</span><h2>Request a demo</h2><p>Evaluation form — please use sample information.<br/>All fields marked * are required.</p><form id="demo-form" method="post" action="/api/demo"><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="firstName">First name *</label><input id="firstName" name="firstName" autocomplete="given-name" required maxlength="80"/></div><div class="field"><label for="lastName">Last name *</label><input id="lastName" name="lastName" autocomplete="family-name" required maxlength="80"/></div></div><div class="field"><label for="email">Work email *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required maxlength="254"/></div><div class="field"><label for="company">Organization *</label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="160"/></div><div class="form-row"><div class="field"><label for="role">Your role *</label><select id="role" name="role" required><option value="">Select your role</option><option>CISO / Security leader</option><option>Security architect</option><option>IT / Infrastructure</option><option>Government / Acquisition</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class="field"><label for="interest">Area of interest *</label><select id="interest" name="interest" required><option value="">Select an area</option>{interests.map(i=><option selected={interest===i}>{i}</option>)}</select></div></div><div class="field"><label for="message">What would you like to explore? <span>(optional)</span></label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Applications, file types or questions for the discussion…"></textarea><small>Please don’t include sensitive data, credentials or protected information.</small></div><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label for="website">Leave this field empty</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"/></div><label class="checkbox-label"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" value="yes" required/><span>I agree to the handling of this request described <a href="#privacy">below</a>. *</span></label><button type="submit" class="button button-dark submit-button">Submit demo request <Arrow/></button><div class="form-feedback" id="form-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" tabindex="-1"></div><p class="form-local-note">Evaluation only: this form validates sample details. No request is saved or sent to Cyber Reliant.</p></form><div id="privacy" class="privacy-note"><h3>About your demo request</h3><p>This prototype processes sample details only to validate the form. It does not store a demo request or deliver one to Cyber Reliant. Use sample information when testing. Durable lead storage, contact routing, retention and a company-approved privacy notice are required before collecting real requests.</p></div></div></section></Layout>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#demo-form');
form?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;const feedback=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#form-feedback')!;button.disabled=true;button.textContent='Validating…';feedback.textContent='';feedback.className='form-feedback';try{const response=await fetch('/api/demo',{method:'POST',body:new FormData(form),headers:{Accept:'application/json'}});if(!response.headers.get('content-type')?.includes('application/json'))throw new Error('The server could not accept the request. Please reload this page and try again.');const result=await response.json();if(!response.ok)throw new Error(result.error||'Unable to validate the form. Please try again.');feedback.textContent='Evaluation complete. Your sample details passed validation. No request was saved or sent to Cyber Reliant.';feedback.classList.add('success');form.reset();}catch(error){feedback.textContent=error instanceof Error?error.message:'Unable to validate the form. Please try again.';feedback.classList.add('error');}finally{button.disabled=false;button.innerHTML='Submit demo request <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>';feedback.focus();}});
</script>
